// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <zmk-helpers/helper.h>
#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <behaviors/mouse_keys.dtsi>
#include <behaviors/unicode.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/mouse.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>


#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Num         2
#define Fun         3
#define Game        4
#define Gameplus    5
#define KeysLeft 1 2 34 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25
#define KeysRight 5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31
#define Thumbs 32 33 34 35 36 37

#define UC_AE  0xe4  0xc4  // ä/Ä USAGE - &uc UC_AE /* ä/Ä - same as &uc 0xE4 0xC4 */
#define UC_AO  0xe5  0xc5  // å/Å
#define UC_OE  0xf6  0xd6  // ö/Ö

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

&uc {
    default-mode = <UC_MODE_WIN_COMPOSE>;  // Replace with desired input system.
    win-compose-key = <RALT>;  // replace with desired key   
    minimum-length = <4>;
};

/ {
    behaviors { 


        hml: home_row_mod_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <KeysRight Thumbs>; // List of keys on the right side of the keyboard
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        hmr: home_row_mod_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <KeysLeft Thumbs>; // List of keys on the left side of the keyboard
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        hmrae: home_row_mod_righ_aakkoset {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&uc>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <KeysLeft Thumbs>; // List of keys on the left side of the keyboard
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        spc_bspc: space_backspace {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "SPACE_BACKSPACE";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE>, <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            mods = <(MOD_LCTL)>;
        };

        bspc_del: backspace_delete {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "BACKSPACE_DELETE";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>, <&kp DELETE>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT|MOD_LCTL|MOD_RCTL)>;
        };

        lt_bspc: layer_tap_bspc_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "LAYER_TAP_BACKSPACE_DELETE";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            bindings = <&mo>, <&bspc_del>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
        };

    };

    combos { compatible = "zmk,combos"; };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
//            ╭────────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────╮  ╭──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────╮
                     &kp Q          &kp W          &kp E          &kp R          &kp T              &kp Y         &kp U          &kp I          &kp O          &kp P
//            ├────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤
                  &hml LGUI A     &hml LALT S   &hml LCTRL D   &hml LSHIFT F     &kp G              &kp H      &hmr RSHFT J   &hmr RCTRL K   &hmr RALT L  &hmrae RGUI UC_OE // semicolon to numlayer
//╭───────────┼────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────╮
  &lt 1 ESCAPE       &kp Z          &kp X          &kp C          &kp V          &kp B              &kp N         &kp M        &kp COMMA       &kp DOT       &uc UC_AE    &kp SINGLE_QUOTE // fslash or quote to numlyer
//╰───────────┴────────────────┴──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯
                                                &mt LCTRL DEL    &spc_bspc      &kp SPACE     &mt RSHFT RETURN  &lt_bspc 2 0    &kp MINUS
//                                            ╰──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯  ╰──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯
            >;  
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
//            ╭────────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────╮  ╭──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────╮
                    &none           &none          &none          &none          &none             &none         &kp HOME        &none        &kp PG_UP     &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN  
//            ├────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤
                &kp LG(LS(S))      &kp LALT      &kp LCTRL       &kp TAB         &none            &kp LEFT       &kp DOWN        &kp UP       &kp RIGHT     &kp C_PREVIOUS
//╭───────────┼────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────╮
  &trans           &kp RC(Z)        &none          &none          &none          &none             &none         &kp END         &none         &kp PG_DN        &none       &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE
//╰───────────┴────────────────┴──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯
                                                   &to 2         &trans          &trans            &trans       &bspc_del      &kp DOT
//                                            ╰──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯  ╰──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯
            >; 
        };

        Num {
            display-name = "Num";
            bindings = <
//            ╭────────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────╮  ╭──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────╮
                    &none           &none          &none          &none          &none              &none         &kp HOME        &none        &kp PG_UP     &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN  
//            ├────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤
                 &hml LGUI N1    &hml LALT N2   &hml LCTRL N3  &hml LSHIFT N4    &kp N5          &kp LEFT    &hmr RSHFT DOWN &hmr RCTRL UP &hmr RALT RIGHT   &hmr RGUI SEMICOLON
//╭───────────┼────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────╮
  &trans            &kp N6          &kp N7         &kp N8         &kp N9         &kp N0             &none         &kp END         &none         &kp PG_DN        &none       &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE
//╰───────────┴────────────────┴──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤  ├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯
                                                   &to 0         &trans          &trans            &trans       &bspc_del      &kp DOT
//                                            ╰──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯  ╰──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────╯
            >;
        };

        Fun {
            display-name = "Fun";
            bindings = <
        &bootloader  &trans  &trans  &trans  &to 4     &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp END  &kp F1
        &trans       &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans   &kp F10
&trans  &trans       &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans   &kp F20  &kp F7
                             &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            display-name = "Game";
            bindings = <
            &kp Z           &kp X  &kp C      &kp V         &sl 5     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
            &kp TAB         &kp Q  &kp W      &kp E         &kp R     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp ESCAPE  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp A  &kp S      &kp D         &kp F     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                   &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming+ {
            display-name = "Game+";
            bindings = <
        &kp F10  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp T     &kp RA(RC(Y))  &kp RA(RC(U))  &trans  &trans  &kp LC(RA(DEL))
        &kp L    &kp O         &kp Y         &kp K         &kp G     &kp F5         &kp F7         &trans  &trans  &kp F12
&trans  &to 0    &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans    &trans         &trans         &trans  &trans  &kp F22          &kp LA(F4)
                               &kp J         &kp I         &kp M     &trans         &trans         &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
